1322
01:34:46,598 --> 01:34:47,515
Dengarkan sebentar.

1323
01:34:47,516 --> 01:34:49,016
- Tidak, Uri, berhenti.
- Bro, tolong dengarkan.

1324
01:35:04,783 --> 01:35:06,158
