1344
01:39:52,320 --> 01:39:53,780
Aku kecewa.

1345
01:39:57,492 --> 01:39:58,952
Mungkin kamu bisa membantu.

1346
01:40:01,413 --> 01:40:03,163
Maestro, bagian pertama sudah diperiksa

1347
01:40:03,164 --> 01:40:05,791
